~ start
if Global.offered_dumplings == true
	if Global.minigame_success == true
		Rooster: This was delicious! What a wonderful taste of 500 year old heritage.
	else:
		Rooster: This was not what I had asked for.
	set Global.offered_dumplings = false
	=> END

Rooster: Are you the new merchant?
Rooster: I heard that your family sells dumplings to the Jade Emperor.
Rooster: A tradition over 500 years old! How persistent, you must be dedicated to your family heritage. Is there anything you'd like to ask me?

~ main_menu
- Is the Jade Emperor a fan of my family's dumplings?
	Rooster: Why yes. Why else would he continually purchase from your family all these years?
	=> main_menu
- I was hoping to get some advice
	Rooster: Oh? Of course, I'm the Rooster that strategically built the raft and finished 10th in the Great Zodiac Race. I offer great advice to those uncertain about themselves. What do you need help with?
	=> sub_menu
- Offer dumplings
	Rooster: Let's see how good they are! I would like {{GameManager.get_ingredients()}} dumplings.
	set Global.offered_dumplings = true
	do Global.start_dumplings_minigame()
	=> END
- Walk away
if [Global.offered_dumplings == false]
	Rooster: I thought you had something more to say?
	=> END
	
~ sub_menu
- I'm wondering if this is truly my destined path in life.
	Rooster: Destiny is a mysterious thing. I'd recommend talking to other animals to gain more insight.
	=> main_menu
- How can I improve my dumpling-making skills?
	Rooster: Practice makes perfect! Start small and gradually refine your technique.
	=> main_menu
- Back
	=> main_menu
=> END